# ── never publish real personal data ──────────────────────────────────
# The original personal dashboard and, critically, the raw Niantic export it
# was built from (GPS history, friends, purchases). This is exactly the kind
# of data this project exists to keep private — it must never leave the machine.
original-personal-build/

# Internal design notes for the Observation Deck fleet — local only by design.
THEME-HANDOFF.md

# Hand-off notes destined for the observation-deck repo, not this one.
OBSERVATION-DECK-UPDATE.md

# tools/scrub-demo.mjs builds the sample beside itself and renames it into
# place only after its leak check passes. A run killed outright (SIGKILL) can
# strand the unchecked build or the replaced sample here — never commit either.
pogo-metrics/sample-export.tmp-*/
pogo-metrics/sample-export.old-*/

